            string ivBase64 = "your_iv_base64_here";

            await decryptionService.DecryptCiphertextAsync(ciphertext, keyBase64, ivBase64);

            // Simulate updating configuration periodically
            await Task.Delay(30000); // Update every 30 seconds
            await decryptionService.UpdateConfigurationAsync();
        }
    }
    catch (Exception ex)
    {
        decryptionService.LogError(ex.Message);
    }

    decryptionService.Dispose();
}
```

This example demonstrates a simple usage pattern for the `DecryptionService` class, where it continuously decrypts incoming ciphertexts and updates configuration settings at regular intervals. You can customize this code to fit your specific requirements and integrate it with other components of your real-time multiplayer game or application.

